codex
The full Firefox sequence exposed a second, more precise state of the same F-03 defect: after prior canvas measurements, the card center shifts to `(381.83, 226.27)`, directly under the real `1:1` button. I’m preserving the buttons and moving the wide short-landscape cluster into the sticky control’s already-reserved top row (`>768px` only), while retaining the dock-width horizontal offset. This avoids changing the separate 568px S5/S3 QA cells.
apply patch
